  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Internal Control review TradeMark Africa (TMA)</narrative>
   <narrative xml:lang="SV">Internal Control review TradeMark Africa (TMA)</narrative>
  </title>
  <description type="1">
   <narrative xml:lang="SV">Insatsen kommer fr&#xe4;mst att fokusera p&#xe5; en analys av TMA:s intern styrning och kontroll. Detta f&#xf6;r att avg&#xf6;ra om dessa kan garantera kvalitet i leverans och noggrannhet i hela organisationskedjan. Uppdraget omfattar en genomg&#xe5;ng d&#xe4;r rutiner och system f&#xf6;r operativ och finansiell kontroll granskas och analyseras av Ernest &amp; Young.</narrative>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">This assignment will primarily focus on an analysis of  TMA&#x2019;s internal control systems in order to determine whether these can guarantee quality delivery and accuracy in the entire organizational chain. The assignment includes a review in which routines and systems for operational and financial controls are reviewed and analysed.</narrative>
  </description>
